📅 Attendance System

🎯 Attendance Method

DreamVerse me Attendance System Mix System hoga.

👨‍🏫 Normal Teachers

- Attendance manually le sakte hain.
- Student ka naam lekar ya class list ke hisaab se attendance mark karenge.

⭐ Guest Professor / Special Faculty

- Attendance automatically system dwara mark hogi.
- Unka lecture time bahut important hota hai, isliye unka class time waste nahi hoga.

---

📊 Minimum Attendance

Har college ki attendance requirement alag ho sakti hai.

Minimum attendance percentage:

- 🏛️ College Principal decide karega.
- Har college ke rules alag ho sakte hain.

---

📅 Monthly Attendance Review

Attendance har din record hogi.

Lekin uski official checking:

- 📅 Har mahine hogi.

Jiski attendance kam hogi uske against action liya jayega.

