Kuch colleges me Open Book Exam ho sakta hai.

Student:

- Book
- Notes

saath la sakta hai.

Lekin questions aise honge ki sirf book dekhne se answer nahi milega. Samajhna bhi zaruri hoga.

---

🚫 Exam Cheating Rules

Exam me cheating karte hue pakde gaye to koi warning nahi milegi.

Pehli Baar

👨‍💼 Seedha Principal ke paas.

Agar baar-baar cheating kare:

- Principal strict action lega.

Agar lagatar 5 baar cheating me pakda gaya:

❌ Exam Cancel ho sakta hai.

Player agar smart tareeke se cheating kare aur pakda na jaye to bach sakta hai, lekin risk hamesha rahega.

---

🤒 Exam Miss System

Bimaar

Player ko application deni hogi.

Medical reason batana hoga.

Principal decide karega ki Re-Exam milega ya nahi.

---

🚑 Accident

Player ya uske family members college ko inform karenge.

Situation genuine hui to Re-Exam ka chance milega.

---

❌ Bina Reason

Koi reason nahi diya.

To:

📄 Exam me Zero Marks milenge.

